OL,3,GNEWSAOne arrest after police stop taxi
OL,4,Abeing driven wrong way down dual
OL,5,Acarriageway
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man has been arrested after police
OL,8,Fstopped a taxi travelling the wrong way
OL,9,Fdown a dual carriageway, after a
OL,10,Fcyclist was knocked off their bike and
OL,11,Fparked cars were also damaged.
OL,13,FOfficers intervened on the A55 on
OL,14,FAnglesey on Monday evening and
OL,15,Ftemporarily closed the road, with
OL,16,Ffootage on social media appearing to
OL,17,Fshow a taxi being pulled over by police
OL,18,Fvehicles.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
