OL,3,GNEWSAOne arrest after police stop taxi
OL,4,Abeing driven wrong way down dual
OL,5,Acarriageway
OL,6,
OL,7,FNorth Wales Police said that before the
OL,8,Ftaxi had gone onto the road the cyclist
OL,9,Fhad been knocked off their bike on
OL,10,FLondon Road in nearby Holyhead, and
OL,11,Fseveral parked vehicles had also been
OL,12,Fdamaged.
OL,14,FThe cyclist was taken to hospital with
OL,15,Fnon-life threatening injuries, and the
OL,16,Farrested man remained in custody on
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
